    "type": "game",
    "name": "\u4e1c\u65b9\u5f02\u57df\u89c1\u95fb ~ Touhou Dystopian",
    "steam_appid": 3265060,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/f5f21df0d9a3f3628dd23091e63d1bba.avif?t=1754868717\" data-has-big width=800 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a third-person action roguelite game. Players will play one of several protagonists to challenge powerful enemies in the Animal Realm and solve the source of the mutation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will include 4 protagonists with different fighting styles to unlock, more than 12 boss battles based on various Touhou characters, and nearly 100 kinds of enhanced abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/6fd21e945ff67d1391fb3759c136dbba.webp?t=1754868717\" width=48 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/39473cfbf4f468ebf901098d8dc9d71d.webp?t=1754868717\" width=48 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/5434f7e7cb35f1ac8fa5c858442348ec.webp?t=1754868717\" width=48 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/dacf87bd734858896d628ed981eeb84f.webp?t=1754868717\" width=48 height=48 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfEXCITING BATTLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In terms of combat, the operation is simplified, while the operation threshold is minimized as much as possible, while retaining the tension and excitement brought by action games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Clear all obstacles with flawless skill!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/f95da20e2677ce0bc1d18098fbdd91de.poster.avif?t=1754868717\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/f95da20e2677ce0bc1d18098fbdd91de.webm?t=1754868717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/f95da20e2677ce0bc1d18098fbdd91de.mp4?t=1754868717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfRICH TALENT ENHANCEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the process, each protagonist has a unique enhancement ability to choose from, and some powerful enhancement abilities will directly change the character's fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Face all challenges with the strongest attitude!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/3d9da709114e17ffd6196818bc0fc802.poster.avif?t=1754868717\" width=644 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/3d9da709114e17ffd6196818bc0fc802.webm?t=1754868717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/3d9da709114e17ffd6196818bc0fc802.mp4?t=1754868717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/6a5cb047acb04d98cab1ebbc20d87f07.webp?t=1754868717\" width=48 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/af0c7b8884e50e7893cdf32b5aa2a763.webp?t=1754868717\" width=48 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/409c28ad1f999d17d2f76abae5bcb8b5.webp?t=1754868717\" width=48 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/b18333408bf8c0f1f4e90a59ff72bd31.webp?t=1754868717\" width=48 height=48 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfHIGHLY ANTICIPATED CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Primate Spirit Garden is restored, it will attract visitors of all kinds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will meet visitors of different characteristics in the game and get their help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Let\u2019s liven up the Primate Spirit Garden!</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/c029288d63f8656467c6ce86a38fbcaa.poster.avif?t=1754868717\" width=644 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/c029288d63f8656467c6ce86a38fbcaa.webm?t=1754868717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/c029288d63f8656467c6ce86a38fbcaa.mp4?t=1754868717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/f5f21df0d9a3f3628dd23091e63d1bba.avif?t=1754868717\" data-has-big width=800 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a third-person action roguelite game. Players will play one of several protagonists to challenge powerful enemies in the Animal Realm and solve the source of the mutation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will include 4 protagonists with different fighting styles to unlock, more than 12 boss battles based on various Touhou characters, and nearly 100 kinds of enhanced abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/6fd21e945ff67d1391fb3759c136dbba.webp?t=1754868717\" width=48 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/39473cfbf4f468ebf901098d8dc9d71d.webp?t=1754868717\" width=48 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/5434f7e7cb35f1ac8fa5c858442348ec.webp?t=1754868717\" width=48 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/dacf87bd734858896d628ed981eeb84f.webp?t=1754868717\" width=48 height=48 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfEXCITING BATTLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In terms of combat, the operation is simplified, while the operation threshold is minimized as much as possible, while retaining the tension and excitement brought by action games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Clear all obstacles with flawless skill!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/f95da20e2677ce0bc1d18098fbdd91de.poster.avif?t=1754868717\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/f95da20e2677ce0bc1d18098fbdd91de.webm?t=1754868717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/f95da20e2677ce0bc1d18098fbdd91de.mp4?t=1754868717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfRICH TALENT ENHANCEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the process, each protagonist has a unique enhancement ability to choose from, and some powerful enhancement abilities will directly change the character's fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Face all challenges with the strongest attitude!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/3d9da709114e17ffd6196818bc0fc802.poster.avif?t=1754868717\" width=644 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/3d9da709114e17ffd6196818bc0fc802.webm?t=1754868717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/3d9da709114e17ffd6196818bc0fc802.mp4?t=1754868717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/6a5cb047acb04d98cab1ebbc20d87f07.webp?t=1754868717\" width=48 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/af0c7b8884e50e7893cdf32b5aa2a763.webp?t=1754868717\" width=48 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/409c28ad1f999d17d2f76abae5bcb8b5.webp?t=1754868717\" width=48 height=48 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/b18333408bf8c0f1f4e90a59ff72bd31.webp?t=1754868717\" width=48 height=48 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cfHIGHLY ANTICIPATED CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Primate Spirit Garden is restored, it will attract visitors of all kinds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will meet visitors of different characteristics in the game and get their help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Let\u2019s liven up the Primate Spirit Garden!</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/c029288d63f8656467c6ce86a38fbcaa.poster.avif?t=1754868717\" width=644 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/c029288d63f8656467c6ce86a38fbcaa.webm?t=1754868717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265060/extras/c029288d63f8656467c6ce86a38fbcaa.mp4?t=1754868717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>",
